# Cryogenic Stasis taps and stuns before its draw instruction (CR 608.2c).
# Words of Wind replaces that draw with returning a permanent (CR 614.1a, 121.6).
# At the return choice the targeted Memnite is already tapped with a stun counter;
# returning it records that tapped state, and no card is drawn from the library.

